    - Updated `upload` method so that non-chunked uploads (images) pass `file.getBytes()` to `cloudinary.uploader().upload(file.getBytes(), options)`.
    - Maintained `uploadLarge(inputStream, options, VIDEO_CHUNK_BYTES)` inside a try-with-resources stream for chunked media (videos).
  - `backend/src/test/java/com/indore/pathome/spaces/service/CloudinaryServiceTest.java`:
    - Updated image upload unit tests (`uploadsImageWithStablePublicIdentifier` and `reportsInterruptedCloudinaryUpload`) to expect and verify `byte[]` parameters rather than `InputStream`.

