       - In addition, iOS Safari does not support `recognition.continuous = true` (which triggers instant recognition aborts or failures).
       - Reusing a single stale `SpeechRecognition` instance across stops/starts on WebKit causes `InvalidStateError`.
    2. **Extra Mic Icon**:
       - In `MasterAdminDashboard.tsx`, the Dictate button rendered both a Lucide `<Mic />` icon AND `'🎤 Dictate details'`, resulting in two microphones displayed side-by-side.

