    - Updated speech recognition to instantiate fresh sessions on demand, preventing stale session crashes.
    - Set `recognition.continuous = !isIOSOrSafari` to prevent iOS Safari SpeechRecognition crashes.
    - Added informative user feedback in `recognition.onerror`: detects non-secure LAN HTTP origins and informs the user that mobile browsers require HTTPS for in-browser speech recognition, while offering the immediate tip to tap the native microphone button on their smartphone virtual keyboard to dictate directly into the text field.
